        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"78630be3-cfa9-4cb9-a264-7801164f7e8a\",\"review_text\":\"Cheapest therapist...✨\"},{\"review_id\":\"3e791a46-a5e0-4fa7-843e-8296e464e635\",\"review_text\":\"The ads are extremely loud while the content is too low 😞\"},{\"review_id\":\"a4ca06f0-e706-4fca-bd0d-e4f36018025f\",\"review_text\":\"The more you use it the better it is\"},{\"review_id\":\"6e945e2b-bea0-4e80-88d5-ae44ddf6d94a\",\"review_text\":\"Not related to the playstore version of Spotify, but I am so frustrated with the app on Playstation 5. It just stops playing after a few songs. And what makes it worse is when it tries to play an ad but can't recognize it. I have to restart my system every time it happens.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a041c5d5-962d-4988-91c7-a2d6d2ed828a\",\"review_text\":\"Till date was ok continuosly for paid service when i was listining to a devotional song continuosly, they deleted the song from the list....shameful Spotify..change the name because nothing is spoty only the porpously added bakwas advertise to force for paid service ...chor deleted your app....faltu hai\"},{\"review_id\":\"f5adab59-c785-4ac0-8be8-fff36b20ee4d\",\"review_text\":\"What! A fabulous app\"},{\"review_id\":\"da0d2a4d-71a6-411b-bf74-61974cea3cd5\",\"review_text\":\"THIS APP IS AMAZING! I use this app all the time! However Everytime I wanna play the same song it switches to another song. I recommend audiomack if u want an mp3 experience. Overall, good app!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"fc65541c-8bb8-44e9-ad9d-a1164dcdf384\",\"review_text\":\"All unremastered Beatles songs have been replaced by the remastered versions. Otherwise, very good\"},{\"review_id\":\"19d9ba7e-d0d6-4840-a5b5-b3d77e967c56\",\"review_text\":\"Too much advertisements. I hate it for the same.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b0e77da0-0301-40ee-9492-c2d99aea2cd6\",\"review_text\":\"Kasi kinikilig ako sa youngliz!!!!\"},{\"review_id\":\"5746ddc3-136f-47e1-a8ab-f559f5e45967\",\"review_text\":\"Without premium app is kinda garbo but once u got premium it's the best app for streaming music\"},{\"review_id\":\"811dfc41-ee64-478e-a240-62602ca92f32\",\"review_text\":\"Bun palat ki ads hani, isih bha roh bun pakat ki\"},{\"review_id\":\"1f491391-f790-465b-9742-8b688fdf85d9\",\"review_text\":\"The updates are worse\"},{\"review_id\":\"00bc5c2d-c9fc-44e8-a9eb-8a7ca83019a8\",\"review_text\":\"app doesn't open, crashes constantly. Can't update\"},{\"review_id\":\"bfc33f09-5755-464f-a2f5-7b1a7c22a3ac\",\"review_text\":\"Love it easy-to-use.\"},{\"review_id\":\"2e0cd6bc-46f7-413c-a803-e68d1b441caa\",\"review_text\":\"The new update is awful. I don't like this new thing where I'm scrolling down and it starts blasting random music thats being suggested. It shouldn't play anything until I click it. Very frustrating and annoying. Change it back.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ca19518d-70a5-423e-b69a-47ddaf2902de\",\"review_text\":\"Rating is only 1.1 how can you say #1 grossing music app ? Worst App\"},{\"review_id\":\"dbfb50c1-55ed-4b17-8fd0-427998bd39e6\",\"review_text\":\"It works when it wants to... Even if set on off-line mode you need internet to access your music. I live in a dead zone, and I can't access any of my music unless I drive down the road, get internet, and then it plays. Sometimes I have to reset or redownload the app for it to plan any of my playlists. It's always done this, but now it's worse.\"},{\"review_id\":\"548d3472-4205-4936-bd94-8e9ff8dd6de2\",\"review_text\":\"My experience was awful they gave Ms 30 minutes of uninterrupted but it was only 3 minutes and they gave me an ad\"},{\"review_id\":\"60a03633-2149-4db0-ad40-80bec748dc57\",\"review_text\":\"Great app. Pretty much every song in the multiverse\"}]}"
      }
